      "translations": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "zh": "」隆興元年，復召。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "zh": "入對，其一言：「大學之道在乎格物以致其知。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "zh": "陛下雖有生知之性，高世之行，而未嘗隨事以觀理，即理以應事。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "zh": "是以舉措之間動涉疑貳，聽納之際未免蔽欺，平治之效所以未著。」",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "zh": "其二言：「君父之讐不與共戴天。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "zh": "今日所當為者，非戰無以復讐，非守無以制勝。」",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "zh": "且陳古先聖王所以強本折衝、威制遠人之道。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "zh": "時相湯思退方倡和議，除熹武學博士，待次。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "zh": "乾道元年，促就職，既至而洪适為相，復主和，論不合，歸。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "zh": "三年，陳俊卿、劉珙薦為樞密院編修官，待次。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "zh": "五年，丁內艱。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "zh": "六年，工部侍郎胡銓以詩人薦，與王庭珪同召，以未終喪辭。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "zh": "七年，既免喪，復召，以祿不及養辭。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "zh": "九年，梁克家相，申前命，又辭。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "zh": "克家奏熹屢召不起，宜蒙褒錄，執政俱稱之，上曰：「熹安貧守道，廉退可嘉。」",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 15,
          "zh": "特改合入官，主管台州崇道觀。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "zh": "熹以求退得進，於義未安，再辭。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 17,
          "zh": "淳熙元年，始拜命。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 18,
          "zh": "二年，上欲獎用廉退，以勵風俗，龔茂良行丞相事以熹名進，除秘書郎，力辭，且以手書遺茂良，言一時權幸群小，乘間讒毀，乃因熹，再辭，即從其請，主管武夷山沖佑觀。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
